title AST Parsing & Incremental Reparse

start
:**source: &str** (+ optional old Tree, EditInfo);
:safe_hash(source) ▷ parse-cache probe
(≤ 16 entries, cleared on overflow); <<#546E7A>>
if (cached source matches?) then (hit)
  :reuse cached Tree; <<#00838F>>
else (miss)
  :tree-sitter Parser::parse(source, old_tree); <<#546E7A>>
  if (tree produced?) then (yes)
    :insert (source, tree) into cache; <<#EF6C00>>
  else (no)
    :AstError::ParseFailed; <<#C62828>>
    stop
  endif
endif
:root_node().has_error()?; <<#EF6C00>>
if (has errors?) then (yes)
  :collect_errors ▷ Vec<ErrorRange>
(ERROR / MISSING spans); <<#EF6C00>>
else (clean)
  :error_ranges = []; <<#EF6C00>>
endif
:**ParsedCode**
{ tree, source, language_name,
  has_errors, error_ranges };
:AstNode::from_ts_node ▷ owned
depth-first AST (kind, span, text); <<#EF6C00>>
:descendants() · find_by_kind() · find_errors();
stop

